Codicons
========

codicon.ttf is the icon font of Microsoft's Codicons, from the npm package
@vscode/codicons version 0.0.46-43 (the version the vendored VS Code /
Monaco sources depend on):

  https://registry.npmjs.org/@vscode/codicons/-/codicons-0.0.46-43.tgz
  sha512-E9PUY2D+koeiVN6Pe3QBAVDxc0ZTLIlXbgTvqla2vt9eL+9Z9GtJzSsIfQ9GUgwQ9KEHDx2iTMylTzFfdWCfDg==
  Source: https://github.com/microsoft/vscode-codicons

