Changes: the font's cmap also maps U+006D (`m`) to the `add` icon's glyph,
because GPUI's macOS text system refuses to load fonts without an `m`
glyph. The glyphs and the other tables are unchanged (apart from
the file checksum in `head`). The change is made
by patch-codicon-font.py next to this file:

  ./patch-codicon-font.py package/dist/codicon.ttf codicon.ttf

This crate's only code (src/lib.rs, which embeds the font) and the patch
script are trivial and carry no license terms beyond the font's.

The icon ids and code points in gpui-monaco's src/codicons.rs (MIT OR
Apache-2.0, not part of this crate) are generated from Monaco's
`codiconsLibrary.ts` and `codicons.ts` (VS Code, MIT License, Copyright (c)
Microsoft Corporation).

